              ],
              "Definitions": [
                {
                  "cell": "A1",
                  "text": "For more information, please see: Moskowitz, Tobias J., Yao Hua Ooi and Lasse. H. Pedersen, 2012, \u201cTime Series Momentum,\" Journal of Financial Economics, 104(2), 228-250."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A2",
                  "text": "Not all data described here may be shown on the data tab based on the user's request. Please see www.aqr.com for the full selection of available data."
                },
                {
