                  "text": "Disclosures"
                }
              ],
              "TSMOM Factors": [
                {
                  "cell": "A1",
                  "text": "AQR Capital Management, LLC \u2014 Time Series Momentum: Factors, Monthly"
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A3",
                  "text": "This file contains the excess returns of the long/short Time Series Momentum (TSMOM) factors."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A4",
                  "text": "The portfolios are an updated and extended version of the factors used in Moskowitz, Tobias J., Yao Hua Ooi and Lasse H. Pedersen, 2012, \u201cTime Series Momentum,\" Journal of Financial Economics, 104(2), 228-250."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A5",
                  "text": "The portfolio construction is based on Moskowitz, Ooi and Pedersen (2012), however there can be differences in data sources and methodology. See the Data Sources and Definition tabs for details."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A7",
                  "text": "We report the monthly excess returns of the time series momentum factors for all assets (no superscript), global equity indices (EQ), currencies (FX), fixed income (FI), and commodities (CM)"
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A8",
                  "text": "The TSMOM factor here is a 12-month time series momentum strategy with a 1-month holding period."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A9",
                  "text": "Not all available data may be displayed below based on the user's selection. Please see www.aqr.com for the full selection of available data."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A11",
                  "text": "Data are updated and maintained by AQR, www.aqr.com."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A12",
                  "text": "Data are updated as they become available. AQR reconstructs the full history each time the returns are updated."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A13",
                  "text": "Copyright \u00a92012 Tobias Moskowitz, Yao Hua Ooi, and Lasse Heje Pedersen"
                },
                {
                  "cell": "A15",
                  "text": "Please see disclosures on the Disclosures tab."
                },
                {
                  "cell": "B18",
                  "text": "TSMOM"
                },
                {
                  "cell": "C18",
                  "text": "TSMOM^CM"
                },
